# AI Powered Career Guidance System

## Overview

The AI Powered Career Guidance System is a web-based application that helps students and job seekers identify suitable career paths based on their skills, interests, education, and uploaded resumes. The system provides AI-based career recommendations, resume analysis, skill gap analysis, and an AI chatbot for career guidance.

---

## Features

- User Registration & Login
- Secure Authentication
- Student Dashboard
- AI Career Recommendation
- Resume Upload & Analysis
- Skill Gap Analysis
- AI Career Chatbot
- User Profile Management
- Feedback Module
- Admin Login
- Admin Dashboard
- Career Management
- Responsive User Interface
- MySQL Database Integration

