## AI Recommendation Features

The system analyzes:

- User Skills
- Interests
- Education
- Resume Content

It recommends careers such as:

- AI Engineer
- Data Scientist
- Software Engineer
- Frontend Developer
- Backend Developer
- Full Stack Developer
